 and get what he longs for. Guiding him on the path to victory is the mysterious Sakura Banka. Now, the stage is set in Shin Kyoto as Teruto dives headfirst into battle.<br><br>(Source: Funimation)", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 12, "duration": 24, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MULTIMEDIA_PROJECT", "hashtag": "#ビルディバイド", "genres": ["Action", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Gambling", "rank": 95, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Card Battle", "rank": 93, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Amnesia", "rank": 84, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Yandere", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Idol", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 75, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Virtual World", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tragedy", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Isekai", "rank": 28, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Fishing", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 132527, "title": {"romaji": "Aoi Hane Mitsuketa!", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The story centers on Haru and Hina, two siblings who live in the city and get along well. One day they find a beautiful blue feather on the road, and they set out to find its owner. A mysterious crow appears before them, and acts as a guide. The three then go on a journey to find the owner, meeting various birds along the way.<br><br>(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 6}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 6, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "PICTURE_BOOK", "hashtag": "#青い羽みつけた", "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Primarily Child Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 132528, "title": {"romaji": "Kaginado", "english": "KAGINADO"}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": "Laughs and shenanigans are on the horizon in this crossover! Fan-favorite characters from <i>Kanon</i>, <i>Air</i>, <i>Clannad</i>, <i>Little Busters!</i>, <i>Rewrite</i>, and more start the school year together in a new world where anything is possible. With so much personality in one anime universe, every day feels like a new kind of dream.<br><br>\n(Source: Funimation)", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 12, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#アニメかぎなど #kaginado", "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Crossover", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 96, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Chibi", "rank": 95, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Slapstick", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Meta", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 45, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Baseball", "rank": 30, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 132545, "title": {"romaji": "Dakaretai Otoko 1-i ni Odosarete Imasu.: Spain-hen", "english": "DAKAICHI -I'm being harassed by the sexiest man of the year- the Movie: Spain Arc"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Azumaya and Takato are set to star in “Blood Wedding,” a two-person play that incorporates flamenco dancing. Takato begins rehearsing but realizes how vast the skill difference is between him and Azumaya. So he decides to travel to Spain in order to learn about passion. Azumaya is still stuck in the part of his past when Takato said goodbye to him without giving him any say in the matter...\n<br><br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll)", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 10}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 1, "duration": 78, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#だかいち", "genres": ["Comedy", "Drama", "Romance"], "tags": [{"name": "Boys' Love", "rank": 88, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Dancing"